        "heading_raw": "Benefit",
        "body_raw": "When you wear a type of armor with which you are proficient, the armor check penalty for that armor applies only to Dexterity- and Strength-based skill checks."
      },
      {
        "heading_raw": "Normal",
        "body_raw": "A character who is wearing armor with which he is not proficient applies its armor check penalty to attack rolls and to all skill checks that involve moving."
      },
      {
        "heading_raw": "Special",
        "body_raw": "All characters except monks, sorcerers, and wizards automatically have Light Armor Proficiency as a bonus feat. They need not select it."
